    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 72,
        "text": "Hi, Lucy. Are you free to talk about the library's new opening hours?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "835df42b3ef5232f83ba281c7ef2f2e0ddd80eb39a6e95aee70b046d4bca4d65",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 76,
        "sourceEnd": 148,
        "text": "Yes, sure. I heard they changed them last week. What's the new schedule?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "6c77e1d2859f1d0f6bbd3d337c34ed9f4f49414a7998fc3b477607370b812a91",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 152,
        "sourceEnd": 310,
        "text": "Well, from Monday to Friday, the library opens at nine in the morning and closes at eight in the evening. But on Saturdays, it opens at ten and closes at six.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "ae87da5504ba5266dcc2cb9c99e42cc10cb20d2258bb8defb23bf6d966999419",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 314,
        "sourceEnd": 389,
        "text": "Wait, did you say eight in the evening on weekdays? I thought it was seven.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "3a45d55a2b060843b48149c93e5609a314d49a99e4fc2935ddde4e3c52105a92",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 393,
        "sourceEnd": 498,
        "text": "No, it's eight. They extended it because more students are using it. And on Sundays, it's closed all day.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "f89a0499b2500d962fd03440c138d8ba519ad379fb5ad006980e07d5f422c8cb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 502,
        "sourceEnd": 584,
        "text": "That's a problem for me. I usually study on Sunday afternoons. Where can I go now?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "27c0eae830af1705005027a5357ae18c1d2e1c585bac84676ff38b3f5e9ff895",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 588,
        "sourceEnd": 697,
        "text": "The city library is open on Sundays from ten to four. But it's a bit far. You need to take the number 15 bus.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "b86a624c5be5f4dcb04cc1e4af4351ccb711ca0d41667d7baf08b1c0b420f242",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 701,
        "sourceEnd": 725,
        "text": "How long does that take?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "a1eb78427b534d0ab96d98032bd2d00006a75ca6b1b99dc6f55ba3659441b0af",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 729,
        "sourceEnd": 804,
        "text": "About twenty minutes. But the bus comes every half hour, so you might wait.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "0fd9b87b5fb2143e75eb50ab1ea6b41fb10fcdcf8545baa22bcee6e29d6b8449",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 808,
        "sourceEnd": 877,
        "text": "Okay. By the way, does the community library have a quiet study room?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "6b0a6ce3aab0ee3042d634290ea985db6298fc4b31c15203421d9dd8b1d8f87b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 881,
        "sourceEnd": 994,
        "text": "Yes, it does. It's on the second floor. But you have to book it online. You can book up to three days in advance.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "eb054a3766c87125b136b452cf6233bf93c54430790286996476fa2ee13841aa",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 998,
        "sourceEnd": 1048,
        "text": "That's good to know. And can I bring my own books?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "dc717bb7320d2a412c4fdf34858aa0eb049c32260b7da7cd2008a0276a4f69ab",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1052,
        "sourceEnd": 1128,
        "text": "Of course. But you can't bring food into the study room. Drinks are allowed.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "f4063dc89c68b986aea0c410871a75e49de06f8ae5b64e57ab6bfefe8a6ca3a7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1132,
        "sourceEnd": 1202,
        "text": "I see. Thanks for the information. I'll check the website for booking.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "0b2f15df572e417ed1978155bc2fc18649b07da15e1c96fcb26905bafc50615a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1206,
        "sourceEnd": 1290,
        "text": "You're welcome. Don't forget your library card. You need it to enter the study room.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "fe640079661fe8a7a135750b6dc8c69b997353fe1885e8c16878834f09b3c097",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
